@startuml 030 Intent-Aware Chunking Architecture
' Feature 030-intent-aware-chunking — two-granularity retrieval topology
' Render: scripts/Render-PlantUml.ps1 (PNG) or PlantUML tooling (SVG)
' NOTE: no !theme directive for renderer compatibility
' Dialect: rectangle/actor/package (JS-engine safe; no [bracket] components).
skinparam defaultFontSize 15

package "LAN workstation :5001 HTTPS" {
  rectangle "wpf-client\nAsk + Broad/Auto/Specific" as client
  rectangle "query-controller\nPOST /api/queries - mode" as api
  rectangle "intent-classifier\nrule-based - Broad|Granular" as classifier
  rectangle "retrieval-service\ngranular: child / broad: parent" as retrieval
  rectangle "ingest-service\nchunk 512/50 - group parents" as ingest
  rectangle "backfill-service\nre-index stale docs" as backfill
  database "sqlite rag.db\nDocuments - Chunks(Level,ParentId)\nQueries(+Mode)" as sqlite
  rectangle "lancedb\nchild vectors + parentId" as lance
  rectangle "ollama\n:11434 loopback - embed + chat" as ollama
}

client --> api : query + mode\nauto|broad|specific
api --> classifier : auto -> classify
api --> retrieval : resolved intent
retrieval --> lance : search child vectors
retrieval --> sqlite : resolve parent rows
retrieval --> ollama : embed query
api --> ollama : grounded chat
ingest --> lance : upsert child vectors
ingest --> sqlite : persist children + parents
backfill --> ingest : re-enqueue stale Ready docs
backfill --> sqlite : find docs w/o parent row

note right of classifier : No LLM call - offline,\nzero added latency (FR-006, SC-005)
note right of lance : Child vectors only (2b);\nparents are groups, not embedded
note bottom of sqlite : No company_id (Constitution I);\nVectorSize stays 1024
@enduml
